"hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:"
1725,"**
Narrated to us Muḥammad ibn Bashshār: narrated to us Abū ʿĀmir: narrated to us Ibrāhīm (who is the son of Ṭahmān), on the authority of Abū Jamrah al-Ḍubaʿī, on the authority of Ibn ʿAbbās (RA), who said:
""The first Friday prayer ever held after the Friday prayer held in the Mosque of the Messenger of Allāh (ﷺ) in the Mosque of ʿAbd al-Qays in Juwāthā, in Bahrain."""
